    "turn_text": "Yeah, well, they've been dodging and ducking Jim Jordan's committee, and they've been uncooperative. The same thing with Jim Comer's committee. He was on TV last night telling me that he's got no option now. The Biden family syndicate won't cooperate. So they've now got to send out subpoenas and work their way through that process, which doesn't surprise me. I would imagine that whatever is necessary has to at some point be forthcoming. Um, you know, considering the amount of money that we're talking about and the president's inability to deal with China. I think it's a legitimate question to know how much money the Biden family may have made and deals with China. I think that's a pretty fair question. All right. Quick break more with Congresswoman Debbie Lusco of Arizona on the other side. Then we'll get to your calls eight hundred nine four one Sean, our number if you want to be a part of the program as we continue. Look folks, if you're concerned about your kid's education, K through 12, if you're worried about what your children and grandchildren are learning or not learning in school. Now, if you answered yes, like most parents, well, our good friends at Hillsdale College are offering you a free resource and you've heard me talking about how Hillsdale College understands the importance of education for the future of our country. So now they're offering you 10 free print copies of the recent issue of in Primus. That's a speech digest, a monthly speech digest that's for free. It's entitled Education as a Battleground, was written by Hillsdale College President Dr. Larry Arn. Now, this special issue provides a factual account of the issues in the ongoing battle over education. It explains why parents and teachers, not bureaucrats or activists, should be the real guide of what our kids are learning in school and with Hillsdale College. Well, you can make such a difference in your community by distributing these copies of in-premise. You give it away at church, your local business, maybe fellow parents at your local school, leave one in your doctor's office, whatever. Anyway, don't miss the opportunity to arm yourself with information and facts. Get your free 10 copies, education as a battleground. Just go to their website. It's Sean for Hillsdale.com, a special website we've set up. That's S-E-A-N-F-O-R Hillsdale.com. Join now the battle over our country's future is happening as we speak.",
