    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "Well, I hope it gets done. I think we got to get answers to simple questions. The, you know, the lying and inconsistency is obvious to me. The thought that our own Air Force would be shooting down objects and they don't even know what they're shooting at is incomprehensible to me. the idea that they'd be so quick to say but it has nothing to do with china very long unlikely that that's not that doesn't make sense either uh... the fact that the administration says that the balloon that was flying all over the continental u s uh... not a major breach uh... that doesn't make sense Uh, none of this is making any sense to me. And, and I think we're, we're creating a situation where the Chinese kind of feel emboldened, like they can do whatever they want. And there's not going to be any consequences at all.",
