    "turn_idx": 87,
    "turn_text": "well there's a bit we have we have no evidence whatsoever to believe the news story which is although they were following this balloon prior to it even uh... getting over any airspace in alaska i don't believe that uh... that only came you know yesterday But what came before that was they had no clue. We still have no answer as to the other three objects that they shot down. They can't give us an answer or won't give us an answer. But by all accounts, they didn't know about this first balloon until it was over Montana. And Steve Danes pointed this out the other day. The Senator from Montana Uh, that it was a billings, Montana, you know, reporter with a telephoto lens. They got the picture of it that made everybody aware of it. When they knew about it, we don't know why they didn't tell us if they did know about it. We don't know why they're shooting down things that they can't even identify what they are. I don't know. of this is making any sense. And I think we're being lied to on a pretty sophisticated level.",
